description:
APPLICATION FOR LISTED BUILDING CONSENT FOR REAR EXTENSION;
REAR DORMER; DEMOLITION OF REAR WALL AND REMOVAL OF WINDOW TO INSTALL REAR
DOORS; ROOF LIGHT; AND FRONT PORCH DOORS; RECONFIGURATION OF INTERNAL STAIR;
UNDERFLOOR HEATING; DOWNSTAIRS WET ROOM; REMODELLING OF BATHROOM; REMOVAL OF
BEDROOM CEILING; REINSTATEMENT OF SOME ORIGINAL FEATURES; NEW MEZZANINE FLOOR;
CHANGES TO KITCHEN LAYOUT.

